ory, so a planted `json.py` runs on `import json`. Run any Python that reads them with `-I`. This does not apply to code the user asked you to build or run.\n - In `curl`, send untrusted values with `--form-string`, not `-F`.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/danie/quantum-icing-qoro","sessionId":"a6aa0d7e-04c8-4702-8eda-952590908d5e","version":"2.1.330","gitBranch":"main","dataFlowOn":true}
